              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory"} Introduction to Stable homotopy theory
            (
            %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+1-1#HomotopyCofiberSequencesAreHomotopyFiberSequencesInSpectra"}> this Prop.
            , following
            %a{:href => "equivariant+stable+homotopy+theory#LewisMaySteinberger86"} Lewis-May-Steinberger 86, chapter III, theorem 2.4
            )
            %p In fact:
            %p
            #HomotopyPullbacksOfSpectraAreHomotopyPushouts.num_prop
              %h6 Proposition
              %p
              %p
                A
                = succeed "-" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+coherent+diagram"} homotopy
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/commuting+square"} commuting square
                in
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Spectra"} Spectra
                is a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+pullback"} homotopy pullback
                if and only it is a
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+pushout"} homotopy pushout
